	(text "R4005/C4002 and R4006/C4003 each use 100 Ohm and 1 nF: nominal RC = 0.10 us.\nThese resistors isolate the buffer from ADC capacitance. ADC acquisition time\nand channel-switch delay must include amplifier and source settling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
