	(text "U4001 channel A follows MUX_I_COM and drives ADC_I; channel B follows MUX_V_COM\nand drives ADC_V. The controller receives ADC_I on PA0/ADC_IN0 and ADC_V on\nPA1/ADC_IN1. U4001 and C4001 use AON and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 68.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c25e3c9d-a03b-4cd9-b3d9-12fb3accb9a9")
	)
	(text "Telemetry ADC buffers and default states"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 26.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.05 2.05)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c448c640-f8bd-4916-bdc1-f1976be49ae1")
	)
	(text "This sheet drives the power-manager ADC from the selected MIRA supply monitors.\nTwo unity-gain buffers keep ADC sampling current out of the high-impedance\ntelemetry sources and preserve the current/voltage channel pairing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8df1112-f8b0-473e-a3b6-3533c397f951")
	)
	(text "Current and voltage buffers\nPA0 = ADC_I; PA1 = ADC_V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 95.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e1284ca5-7484-4203-9c3f-435adfa322cf")
	)
	(text "4000_TELEMETRY_ADC_BUFFERS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e5a289ac-1b23-4278-aa65-1f840496713c")
	)
	(text "R4001..R4004 hold MUX_A0..MUX_A3 LOW when the controller releases them. R4007\npulls MUX_DISABLE HIGH, keeping both selectors disconnected by default. R4008\npulls the shared open-drain OC_OK_N signal up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 91.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f457135a-3a8f-43ce-884e-732a01eb15f5")
	)
	(text "Feedback returns directly to each amplifier output before the 100 Ohm resistor.\nInput protection is upstream; the buffers do not add a clamp. Samples require\nvalid AON and enabled selectors. OC_OK_N is a separate hardware fault path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f594fcbd-d338-45da-9223-44ebd6114089")
	)
	(text "Address defaults\nA0..A3 = LOW"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 141.605 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f8a5a12c-830c-4106-8cfc-23893911b08b")
	)
